    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Tiny Tot is the Play Lands unit for younger children, with key users from 3 to 9 years. Children walk up steps instead of a steep climb, and the deck under a hexagonal roof leads to three slides, including a tube slide and an open slide. Activities are kept to climbing and sliding, which is what children of this age go back to again and again. It comes in Royal Turquoise and Play Yellow. The product area is 31'9\" x 24'11\" and the safe play area is 37'9\" x 30'11\". It suits pre-schools, day care centres and the toddler corner of a housing society. The listed capacity is 15. For 3 years, our warranty covers manufacturing defects in its galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Tell us how many children use the space and we will plan around it."
     }
    ]
   }
